---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../../../components/QuoteForm.astro';
import '../../../styles/detail.css';

const title = 'Agricultural Steel Buildings | Livestock & Farm Steel Structures | ZhongSai';
const description = 'ZhongSai Steel Structure provides agricultural steel building solutions for livestock shelters, poultry houses, farm storage and greenhouse frames, with corrosion-resistant design, ventilation planning and durable enclosure systems.';
const lang = 'en';
const canonical = 'https://zhongsai-steelstructure.com/en/agricultural-steel-buildings/';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="detail-hero">
    <div class="detail-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/images/products/app-agriculture-livestock.jpg');"></div>
    <div class="detail-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="detail-hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">Agricultural · Livestock Steel Structure</span>
      <h1>Agricultural Steel Buildings & Livestock Structures</h1>
      <p class="lead">ZhongSai Steel Structure delivers steel structure solutions for agricultural and livestock projects — including poultry houses, livestock shelters, farm storage buildings and greenhouse steel frames. From design detailing to fabrication and export, we support corrosion-resistant framing, ventilation planning, durable enclosure systems and cost-effective farm building supply.</p>
      <div class="detail-hero-actions">
        <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-primary">Get Project Quotation</a>
        <a href="/en/products/" class="btn btn-outline">View All Products</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="detail-breadcrumb">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/en/">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <a href="/en/products/">Products</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span class="current">Agricultural Steel Buildings</span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- 01 / Agricultural Project Requirements -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">01 / Agricultural Project Requirements</p>
        <h2>What Information Is Needed for Agricultural Steel Buildings</h2>
        <p>Agricultural steel buildings require careful planning around animal welfare, ventilation, corrosion resistance and operational efficiency. The following information directly influences structural framing, enclosure specification and building layout.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="requirement-grid">
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="req-icon">01</div>
          <h3>Building Type</h3>
          <p>Poultry house, livestock shelter, farm storage, greenhouse frame or mixed-use agricultural building — different uses require different structural and enclosure configurations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="req-icon">02</div>
          <h3>Ventilation Needs</h3>
          <p>Natural ventilation, mechanical ventilation, tunnel ventilation or mixed systems — airflow requirements affect building dimensions, openings and roof design.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="req-icon">03</div>
          <h3>Corrosion Environment</h3>
          <p>Livestock buildings have higher humidity and ammonia exposure — corrosion-resistant coating and material selection are critical for long-term durability.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="req-icon">04</div>
          <h3>Climate & Location</h3>
          <p>Local wind load, snow load, temperature range and seismic conditions determine structural member sizing and connection design.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="req-icon">05</div>
          <h3>Enclosure System</h3>
          <p>Roof and wall panel type, insulation level, lighting panels and ventilation openings are determined per building use and local climate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="req-icon">06</div>
          <h3>Operational Layout</h3>
          <p>Feed passages, animal zones, equipment access and cleaning routes affect building width, column placement and door openings.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 / Livestock & Poultry Structures -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">02 / Livestock & Poultry Structures</p>
        <h2>Steel Framing for Livestock and Poultry Buildings</h2>
        <p>Livestock and poultry buildings require wide-span, column-free interiors to maximize usable space for animal housing and operational equipment. Steel portal frames provide the structural efficiency needed for these applications.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="image-text-block reverse">
        <div class="itb-image">
          <img src="/images/products/app-agriculture-livestock.jpg" alt="Agricultural steel building livestock structure" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="itb-content">
          <h3>Wide-Span Framing for Agricultural Use</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Portal frame design provides column-free interiors for livestock housing and operational space</li>
            <li>Corrosion-resistant surface treatment specified for high-humidity livestock environments</li>
            <li>Roof slope and ventilation openings designed per building type and climate</li>
            <li>Insulation and enclosure systems configured for animal comfort and energy efficiency</li>
            <li>Specific spans, heights and loads determined per project drawings and technical requirements</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 / Farm Storage & Greenhouse Frames -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">03 / Farm Storage & Greenhouse Frames</p>
        <h2>Farm Storage Buildings and Greenhouse Steel Frames</h2>
        <p>Beyond livestock housing, agricultural projects often require storage buildings for equipment, feed and harvested goods, as well as steel frames for greenhouse and nursery structures.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="feature-img" style="background-image: url('/images/products/05-agriculture-special.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3>Farm Storage Buildings</h3>
            <p>Steel storage buildings for farm equipment, feed storage and agricultural goods, with clear-span interiors and flexible door configurations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="feature-img" style="background-image: url('/images/products/06-custom-engineering.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3>Greenhouse Steel Frames</h3>
            <p>Custom steel framing for greenhouse and nursery structures, supporting glazing systems, ventilation equipment and environmental control installations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 04 / Corrosion & Durability -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">04 / Corrosion & Durability</p>
        <h2>Corrosion Resistance and Long-Term Durability</h2>
        <p>Agricultural environments — especially livestock buildings — present higher humidity, ammonia exposure and corrosive conditions. Material selection and surface treatment directly affect building service life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="image-text-block reverse">
        <div class="itb-image">
          <img src="/images/manufacturing/real/workshop-overview-wide-9815.jpg" alt="Steel structure fabrication corrosion treatment" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="itb-content">
          <h3>Durability Planning for Agricultural Environments</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Surface treatment and coating specified per environmental exposure level</li>
            <li>Material grade and thickness selected for long-term structural performance</li>
            <li>Enclosure materials chosen for corrosion resistance in agricultural settings</li>
            <li>Connection details designed to minimize moisture trapping and corrosion points</li>
            <li>Specific coating systems and material grades determined per project technical requirements</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <a href="/en/manufacturing-quality/" class="btn btn-outline">View Manufacturing Quality</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 05 / Fabrication & Export Supply -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">05 / Fabrication & Export Supply</p>
        <h2>From Drawings to Export Delivery for Agricultural Projects</h2>
        <p>ZhongSai operates its own production base, fabricating agricultural steel building components per project drawings, covering cutting, assembly, welding, surface treatment and quality control.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-flow">
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <h4>Drawings Confirmation</h4>
          <p>Project drawings, BOQ and technical requirements confirmed</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <h4>Design Detailing</h4>
          <p>Detailing design and fabrication drawing preparation</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <h4>Fabrication</h4>
          <p>Agricultural steel component fabrication organized per drawings</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="step-num">04</div>
          <h4>Component Marking</h4>
          <p>Component marking and numbering arranged based on shop drawings</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-num">05</div>
          <h4>Packing & Loading</h4>
          <p>Packing organized by component type and container loading requirements</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-num">06</div>
          <h4>Export Coordination</h4>
          <p>Export documentation support and logistics coordination</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">06 / Related</p>
        <h2>Related Capabilities</h2>
        <p>Explore related ZhongSai capabilities and services for your project.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3><a href="/en/steel-warehouse/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">Steel Warehouse</a></h3>
            <p>Storage and logistics steel buildings</p>
            <a href="/en/steel-warehouse/" style="color: #2563eb; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Learn more →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3><a href="/en/products/custom-engineering/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">Custom Engineering</a></h3>
            <p>Custom steel structure fabrication</p>
            <a href="/en/products/custom-engineering/" style="color: #2563eb; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Learn more →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3><a href="/en/components/roof-wall-cladding-systems/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">Roof & Wall Cladding</a></h3>
            <p>Enclosure system supply</p>
            <a href="/en/components/roof-wall-cladding-systems/" style="color: #2563eb; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Learn more →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3><a href="/en/export-delivery/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">Export Delivery</a></h3>
            <p>Packing, loading and export coordination</p>
            <a href="/en/export-delivery/" style="color: #2563eb; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;">Learn more →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quote Form -->
  <section id="quote" class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <QuoteForm />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
